# OS
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
Desktop.ini

# Local runtime state and secrets - this app normally writes config,
# cache, and logs under %APPDATA%/%LOCALAPPDATA%, never inside the repo.
# These are listed defensively in case that ever changes, and to block
# accidental commits of the Spotify OAuth token cache or client config.
config.json
*.token
*.secret
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
